      "formation_structure": {
        "clearance": "After hostile clearance and medical retreats, Steward targets [1,6], Lava targets [6,6], GALLUS² targets [6,2], and LEFT-facing Durin targets [1,2].",
        "late": "Beagle and Cardigan hold outer approaches. Melantha holds upper central armor; Midnight holds lower central pressure with timed Arts. Returning Durin and newly deployed Lava supplement the final central waves.",
        "lower_survival": "Plume replaces Castle-3 before prolonged runner contact. Ansel [5,3] RIGHT establishes lower healing before Lancet-2 retires.",
        "opening": "Fang and Vanilla intercept the central rows at column 5. Friston-3 and Castle-3 intercept the outer rows. Lancet-2 DOWN heals both pioneers; Hibiscus RIGHT covers both upper blockers.",
        "patrol": "Steward [2,7] UP covers both eastern waits. GALLUS², then Durin [2,6] UP, supplement the upper eastern segment. Hibiscus covers both caster positions."
      },
